---
<FocusLayout lang="en" title="Ricardo Serôdio | Finance & Technology" description="Ricardo Serôdio’s portfolio: banking experience, financial data analysis, technology and digital creation projects." canonical="https://www.ricardoserodio.com/">
<a class="skip" href="#conteudo">Skip to content</a>
<div class="shell">
 <header class="identity">
  <div class="language-switch" role="navigation" aria-label="Language"><a href="/pt/" lang="pt" hreflang="pt">PT</a><a href="/" lang="en" aria-current="page">EN</a></div>
  <a class="monogram" href="#perfil" aria-label="Ricardo Serôdio, home">RS<span>.</span></a>
  <p class="overline">PERSONAL PORTFOLIO</p>
  <h1>Ricardo<br/>Serôdio<span>.</span></h1>
  <p class="profession">Finance <span>&</span> Technology</p>
  <p class="intro">Experience in banking. Curiosity about technology. Projects that make information clearer and bring ideas to life.</p>
  <nav aria-label="Portfolio sections">{navigation.map((item,i)=><a href={'#'+item.id}><span class="nav-line"></span><small>0{i+1}</small>{item.label}</a>)}</nav>
  <div class="identity-bottom"><a class="cv" href="/cv/ricardo-serodio-cv.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View CV <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><div class="socials"><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/rsbig/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn ↗</a><a href="https://github.com/ricardoserodio" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub ↗</a><a href="mailto:contact@ricardoserodio.com">Email ↗</a></div><p class="location">Portugal · International opportunities</p></div>
 </header>
 <main id="conteudo">
  <section id="perfil"><p class="section-label">01 / PROFILE</p><h2>Between the numbers<br/>and what we can build.</h2><p>My background spans banking operations and wealth management. I enjoy understanding information, finding what matters and turning it into something useful.</p><p>In my personal projects, I combine that experience with data analysis, tool development and digital creation. <a href="#digital">Mano de Plata</a> brings that creative and technical side to life.</p><div class="disciplines"><span>Banking</span><span>Data analysis</span><span>Digital tools</span><span>Visual creation</span></div></section>
  <ProjectCases projects={projects} lang="en" />
  <section id="digital"><p class="section-label">03 / TECHNOLOGY & CREATIVITY</p><h2>A space to build.</h2><a class="mdp-image" href="https://manodeplata.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Visit Mano de Plata"><img src="/images/manodeplata-mark.svg" alt="Mano de Plata" width="160" height="160" loading="lazy"/><div><span>PERSONAL PROJECT</span><strong>Mano de Plata</strong><p>From concept to digital presence.</p></div><span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><p>Websites, visual identity and video editing. A portfolio of work exploring the connection between technology, communication and design.</p><div class="tags"><span>Websites</span><span>Visual identity</span><span>Video editing</span><span>Overlays</span></div><a class="text-link" href="https://manodeplata.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Explore work at Mano de Plata ↗</a></section>
  <section id="experiencia"><p class="section-label">04 / EXPERIENCE</p><h2>The foundation of my work.</h2>{experience.map(e=><article class="experience"><p class="period">{e.period}</p><h3>{e.company}</h3><p class="role">{e.role}</p><p>{e.description}</p><details><summary>Responsibilities</summary><ul>{e.bullets.map(b=><li>{b}</li>)}</ul></details></article>)}<details class="credentials"><summary>Education and certifications <span>{completedCredentials.length}</span></summary><div>{completedCredentials.map(c=><a href={c.href} target="_blank" rel="noopener">{c.name}<span>View ↗</span></a>)}</div></details></section>
  <section id="contacto"><p class="section-label">05 / CONTACT</p><h2>An opportunity.<br/>An idea. Let’s talk.</h2><p>For career opportunities in finance and technology, or a conversation about a digital project.</p><a class="contact-cta" href="mailto:contact@ricardoserodio.com">contact@ricardoserodio.com <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><p class="contact-note">Creative projects: <a href="https://manodeplata.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Mano de Plata</a></p></section>
  <footer>Ricardo Serôdio · 2026<a href="/privacy.html">Privacy</a></footer>
 </main>
</div>
<script>
 const links=Array.from(document.querySelectorAll<HTMLAnchorElement>('.identity nav a'));
 const sections=Array.from(document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('main section[id]'));
 function markSection(){let active=sections[0];for(const section of sections){if(section.getBoundingClientRect().top<=180)active=section;}for(const link of links){if(link.hash==='#'+active?.id)link.setAttribute('aria-current','location');else link.removeAttribute('aria-current');}}
 window.addEventListener('scroll',markSection,{passive:true});markSection();
</script>
</FocusLayout>
